WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.830
Umisho EP 9 "Help me forget" TLed by YoshiZumi

01:45.510 --> 01:51.000
With Orizuka-senpai leading the way, our swimmers made it to the Kantou tournament one after another.

01:57.470 --> 02:02.870
From the boys, Ikamasa-senpai made it to the Kantou tournament.

02:02.870 --> 02:05.230
I got in easily with 6th place in the finals.

02:05.640 --> 02:08.710
Well, two swimmers had a premature start.

02:11.140 --> 02:13.730
That's how the Umisho swim team was, but...

02:18.740 --> 02:19.740
There!

02:19.740 --> 02:20.740
Okay!

02:26.250 --> 02:27.850
Geez.

02:27.850 --> 02:31.260
As soon as the prefectural tournament ended, they're all being lazy again.

02:31.260 --> 02:33.130
Why are you all being lazy?!

02:33.130 --> 02:37.290
This year I'm planning on placing in the top of the Kantou; no, the inter-high tournament!

02:37.290 --> 02:38.840
We can't lose our focus yet!

02:45.020 --> 02:50.350
Come to think of it, Senpai, how much money do you think we'll get for the Kantou tournament trip?

02:50.710 --> 02:54.060
Since we got brand new bathing suits, our budget is really low.

02:54.420 --> 02:58.660
The student council is a bunch cheapskates because our team doesn't take this seriously.

02:58.660 --> 03:00.320
Don't worry about it.

03:00.680 --> 03:05.130
I'll go negotiate with them during the club captains' meetings.

03:05.830 --> 03:09.040
You're the reason why no one takes this seriously!

03:09.040 --> 03:11.290
Yes.

03:17.730 --> 03:19.630
Good work today.

03:20.090 --> 03:20.960
Later.

03:20.960 --> 03:21.570
Yeah, see ya.

03:21.570 --> 03:22.300
Bye, bye.

03:22.660 --> 03:24.690
I wonder what's for dinner tonight.

03:24.690 --> 03:27.480
I have a feeling that Makio's dinner is going to be hayashi rice.

03:27.480 --> 03:30.820
I want to eat a creature I've never eaten before.

03:30.820 --> 03:33.020
No, we don't have that kind of stuff.

03:34.290 --> 03:36.280
I can never get bored of watching the two of you.

03:36.640 --> 03:39.400
Come to think of it, where is Orizuka-senpai?

03:40.200 --> 03:43.520
She said she was going to go to the club captains' meeting instead of Ikamasa-senpai.

03:43.520 --> 03:47.200
I think she's arguing with the student council about the budget right about now.

03:48.450 --> 03:52.540
So, why can't you just recognize the swim team's remarkable progress?

03:52.540 --> 03:54.970
We did well in the prefectural tournament and got seven people into the Kantou tournament!

03:54.970 --> 03:55.880
Seven people!

03:56.230 --> 03:59.130
But with these kinds of photographs going around...

04:06.010 --> 04:08.010
It's fake! Fake!

04:08.590 --> 04:13.740
It would probably be easier to get more funds if we had an advisor.

04:13.740 --> 04:15.790
So we don't have one, huh?

04:15.790 --> 04:17.520
I've been wondering about that for a while now.

04:17.870 --> 04:22.220
Well, I heard that when Kise-senpai and the others were 1st years, they had a coach.

04:22.220 --> 04:25.010
The coach wasn't there when I joined, though.

04:25.010 --> 04:28.660
So we had a proper team four or five years ago.

04:28.970 --> 04:31.560
There was no swim team four or five years ago,

04:31.560 --> 04:34.160
because we started the team.

04:34.660 --> 04:36.580
Is that true?

04:37.160 --> 04:40.050
You sound like you want to hear the secret story of how the Umisho swim team was born.

04:40.050 --> 04:40.950
Secret story?

04:40.950 --> 04:44.180
U-Um, I've heard it around three times already, so...

04:44.530 --> 04:48.340
All right, your senpai will tell you guys.

04:48.340 --> 04:49.630
Secret story, secret story!

04:49.630 --> 04:51.330
Please do tell us!

04:51.330 --> 04:53.640
Once she starts talking she won't stop.

04:54.050 --> 04:59.890
Yes, it was around the time when myself, Zuka, and Ikamasa-kun started going to school.

05:04.560 --> 05:06.570
Zuka, good morning!

05:11.610 --> 05:13.140
Sanae, good morning.

05:13.680 --> 05:16.100
This is Orizuka-senpai?

05:16.100 --> 05:18.210
She seems very charming.

05:18.560 --> 05:21.730
Zuka used to have hair like Amuro-chan.

05:21.730 --> 05:25.920
On top of that, she was pleasant and cute back then,

05:26.280 --> 05:29.640
and I also had beautiful long hair back then.

05:30.140 --> 05:32.780
Hey, what club are you going to join, Zuka?

05:33.330 --> 05:37.390
Um, I wanted to join the swim team if they had one,

05:37.740 --> 05:39.130
but they don't have a swim team.

05:39.130 --> 05:44.820
The swim club Zuka started going to in elementary school closed.

05:45.170 --> 05:47.280
I'm definitely gonna join the mahjong club.

05:48.270 --> 05:50.280
Is there a mahjong club?

05:50.290 --> 05:52.260
I'm gonna make one, because we don't have one!

05:52.260 --> 05:54.400
You can't make one in high school.

05:54.400 --> 05:55.290
Leave him alone.

05:56.160 --> 05:57.790
That's right.

05:57.790 --> 06:00.040
If there's no swim team, you can just make one.

06:01.120 --> 06:02.630
What are you talking about?

06:02.630 --> 06:03.840
That's impossible.

06:04.190 --> 06:05.870
That's not true.

06:05.870 --> 06:08.030
You want to swim, right, Zuka?

06:08.850 --> 06:10.420
Then let's make one!

06:10.420 --> 06:12.720
I'll join the swim team with you, okay?

06:13.080 --> 06:14.500
Sanae.

06:15.830 --> 06:20.430
And then the two of us kissed to pledge our unity.

06:23.770 --> 06:27.070
O-Orizuka-senpai is like that?

06:28.260 --> 06:31.200
I don't remembering hearing about that last time.

06:31.550 --> 06:34.340
We said we're going to make it, but...

06:36.650 --> 06:38.320
This is awful!

06:38.320 --> 06:40.500
There's grass everywhere!

06:40.850 --> 06:42.240
Once the pool became too old to use,

06:42.240 --> 06:46.840
they started having swimming practice in the ocean nearby and completely neglected it.

06:46.840 --> 06:51.720
The school wasn't going to remodel the pool for just two people.

06:52.300 --> 06:54.930
I'm stumped.

06:55.280 --> 06:57.550
It's impossible like this.

06:58.190 --> 06:59.570
It's all right.

06:59.570 --> 07:01.440
I'll just join the track team.

07:01.790 --> 07:02.950
Zuka...

07:05.400 --> 07:06.030
You idiot!

07:08.680 --> 07:11.170
Giving up like this...

07:12.840 --> 07:14.280
that's...

07:16.040 --> 07:17.580
not like Zuka!

07:17.970 --> 07:19.390
Sanae...

07:26.280 --> 07:28.630
It looks even more beautiful than last time.

07:28.630 --> 07:32.550
Yes, it was a beautiful friendship.

07:33.910 --> 07:35.990
Nothing is impossible.

07:35.990 --> 07:38.330
Let's clean up the pool together.

07:48.220 --> 07:49.700
Can I lend you a hand?

07:50.870 --> 07:55.560
The man who said that was the new teacher, Tokorozawa-sensei.

07:55.560 --> 07:59.380
I was feeling down, because this school didn't have a swim team,

07:59.380 --> 08:01.580
and I swam throughout college.

08:01.970 --> 08:03.020
Okay?

08:03.020 --> 08:04.890
So let's make one for real.

08:04.890 --> 08:06.300
Our swim team.

08:08.220 --> 08:09.270
However,

08:10.170 --> 08:13.740
you have to have at least three people to form a new club.

08:13.740 --> 08:15.800
We needed one more.

08:16.150 --> 08:17.610
It's impossible.

08:17.610 --> 08:19.390
It's not impossible!

08:19.390 --> 08:21.560
We should be able find at least one more person.

08:21.910 --> 08:24.920
All the teachers said that I can't make a mahjong club.

08:24.920 --> 08:26.110
That's obvious.

08:26.110 --> 08:27.610
This is perfect!

08:27.610 --> 08:29.650
Ikamasa-kun will join the swim team!

08:29.650 --> 08:30.880
That makes it three!

08:31.830 --> 08:35.530
And then we started to run towards one goal,

08:36.060 --> 08:39.790
believing that the swim team would one day be approved.

09:14.310 --> 09:15.910
There!

09:17.080 --> 09:18.530
Please!

09:24.370 --> 09:27.250
If you guys are that serious, I'm fine with it.

09:29.710 --> 09:31.360
Yes!

09:31.360 --> 09:32.480
We did it!

09:35.170 --> 09:37.010
And then finally,

09:40.810 --> 09:42.960
the swim team started moving.

09:42.960 --> 09:46.520
Our hopes and dreams came full circle.

09:54.270 --> 09:55.240
That's how it was.

09:55.590 --> 09:57.430
That's a beautiful story.

09:57.430 --> 09:59.280
That was fun!

09:59.280 --> 10:02.300
I think there were a few different points from the last time I heard it.

10:02.750 --> 10:05.590
So, what happened to the teacher?

10:05.590 --> 10:07.960
I haven't heard past that either.

10:08.870 --> 10:10.290
You want to hear it?

10:14.350 --> 10:16.240
I don't mind telling you guys,

10:21.030 --> 10:23.640
but it's a bit of a sad story.

10:39.200 --> 10:41.820
The story about our coach leaving,

10:41.820 --> 10:43.460
is a bit of a sad story.

10:43.460 --> 10:44.910
You still want to hear it?

10:46.150 --> 10:47.520
Yes!

10:47.520 --> 10:48.960
I do!

10:50.140 --> 10:51.920
As expected, Amuro-chan.

10:52.270 --> 10:53.960
All right, I'll tell you guys,

10:54.420 --> 10:56.460
but you can't tell anyone else.

10:56.460 --> 10:58.700
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

10:56.780 --> 10:59.860
In the end, I think Kise-san just wants to talk.

11:03.460 --> 11:08.480
So the swim team started to practice.

11:11.100 --> 11:11.960
Like this?

11:21.730 --> 11:23.950
You're so lucky, Sanae.

11:24.440 --> 11:25.620
Why?

11:26.170 --> 11:29.740
Because Tokorozawa-sensei is with you all the time,

11:29.740 --> 11:31.380
helping with your form.

11:31.380 --> 11:35.380
Wait, wait, Zuka-chan, is it that you like Sensei?

11:36.970 --> 11:39.390
You want me to tell him?

11:39.390 --> 11:41.390
You don't have to do anything unnecessary!

11:41.390 --> 11:45.680
Yes, Zuka started to like Sensei.

11:41.390 --> 11:42.500
Geez!

11:42.500 --> 11:43.610
Really?

11:48.940 --> 11:51.890
Then can you tell him yourself?

11:52.820 --> 11:54.770
That's...

11:56.280 --> 11:58.820
Do you plan to not tell him your feelings?

12:00.400 --> 12:01.710
It's all right.

12:01.710 --> 12:03.340
Leave it to me!

12:06.360 --> 12:08.130
Really?

12:08.130 --> 12:09.520
I didn't notice.

12:09.930 --> 12:11.560
That Orizuka...

12:12.410 --> 12:15.360
Sensei, you're not dating anyone, right?

12:15.360 --> 12:16.330
Go out with her.

12:16.330 --> 12:18.420
Now, now, we're teacher and student,

12:18.780 --> 12:21.880
and I...

12:21.880 --> 12:23.320
What is it?

12:23.320 --> 12:26.640
I, actually, Kise...

12:27.470 --> 12:29.430
I like you!

12:38.270 --> 12:39.280
Zuka!

12:49.190 --> 12:50.500
Zuka, wait!

13:09.610 --> 13:12.600
Zuka, forget about that guy.

13:15.370 --> 13:17.040
Let's be together forever.

13:17.760 --> 13:19.820
Now, wipe your tears.

13:20.180 --> 13:21.320
That's right.

13:21.320 --> 13:22.820
Wait here.

13:28.100 --> 13:30.280
At times like these, we should eat!

13:30.590 --> 13:34.200
Forget about that guy, let's watch the flowers.

13:34.550 --> 13:35.990
Sanae...

13:37.170 --> 13:39.060
Now, eat up.

13:39.060 --> 13:40.090
Thanks.

13:42.360 --> 13:44.220
To hell with guys!

13:44.220 --> 13:45.670
To hell!

13:46.430 --> 13:48.950
I'm gonna forget about that guy!

13:48.950 --> 13:49.630
That's right.

13:49.630 --> 13:51.210
Forget about him!

13:51.210 --> 13:54.890
So you chose friendship over love, huh?

13:54.890 --> 13:56.920
Hey, Sanae.

14:01.780 --> 14:03.440
Help me forget...

14:18.700 --> 14:20.960
Amazing!

14:21.320 --> 14:22.920
And so...

14:24.360 --> 14:26.720
Hey, what are you two doing?!

14:27.950 --> 14:31.980
A police officer walking on a path through the trees found us.

14:32.930 --> 14:39.290
Since we were committing impure acts, we were suspended.

14:40.980 --> 14:45.300
Tokorozawa-sensei said he was responsible and left Umisho.

14:47.180 --> 14:54.950
We haven't had a real coach on the swim team since then, and Zuka lost interest in men.

14:55.950 --> 14:57.880
It all makes sense.

14:57.880 --> 14:59.560
I got a little nervous though.

14:59.560 --> 15:01.200
That was fun!

15:01.200 --> 15:03.580
Was that a true story?

15:04.150 --> 15:06.970
Are you guys going home now?

15:08.520 --> 15:10.010
Orizuka-senpai!

15:10.290 --> 15:13.180
The club captains' meeting finally ended.

15:13.180 --> 15:16.360
Those student council members are really stubborn.

15:16.950 --> 15:19.400
I'm tired.

15:19.400 --> 15:22.520
Senpai, let's go home!

15:22.520 --> 15:24.840
I forgot. I have to go to a bookstore.

15:24.840 --> 15:25.480
Bye.

15:27.230 --> 15:29.480
What were you guys talking about?

15:29.480 --> 15:31.490
Did my name come up?

15:31.490 --> 15:33.030
Um, no, um...

15:33.320 --> 15:34.170
What is it?

15:34.170 --> 15:35.180
Spit it out.

15:35.180 --> 15:38.000
No, we're not suppose to tell anyone.

15:38.000 --> 15:39.690
What?

15:39.690 --> 15:42.090
So Sanae told you guys something, huh?

15:42.610 --> 15:43.540
Say it.

15:43.800 --> 15:44.640
No...

15:44.640 --> 15:45.830
Um...

15:45.830 --> 15:48.050
What should I do?

15:48.390 --> 15:50.390
Say it!

15:50.390 --> 15:52.550
Yes!

15:55.440 --> 15:58.010
I knew it would be something like that.

15:59.560 --> 16:00.980
I'll tell you this.

16:00.980 --> 16:03.060
That story is full of lies.

16:03.060 --> 16:04.820
Is that so?

16:04.820 --> 16:09.820
Sanae didn't help at all when the team was starting out to begin with.

16:11.400 --> 16:14.360
Hey, Sanae, let's make a swim team together.

16:14.360 --> 16:17.910
Why don't you make it with Ikamasa-kun?

16:19.750 --> 16:22.630
It's definitely impossible.

16:22.630 --> 16:24.450
She constantly complained.

16:24.450 --> 16:26.720
She tried to give up all the time.

16:27.620 --> 16:30.010
And about Tokorozawa-sensei.

16:30.010 --> 16:33.270
I think you're cool, Sensei.

16:33.270 --> 16:36.440
If I'm going to date someone, it'd be with an older person like you, Sensei.

16:36.440 --> 16:37.850
Really?

16:38.190 --> 16:41.530
Because she was teasing Sensei by pretending to have feelings for him...

16:41.530 --> 16:43.340
Hey, hey, Sensei.

16:43.340 --> 16:45.350
Sensei got serious.

16:47.850 --> 16:48.860
He's serious.

16:48.860 --> 16:51.360
1, 2, 1, 2.

16:52.820 --> 16:55.320
It became a rumor that ran around school.

16:55.670 --> 17:02.230
After being called in by the principal, Tokorozawa-sensei was fired for sexually harassing and stalking his students.

17:03.990 --> 17:05.830
Are you serious?

17:05.830 --> 17:07.290
Are you lying or telling the truth?

17:07.290 --> 17:09.590
I don't know who to believe.

17:09.940 --> 17:13.800
Um, let's see, then, oh, there it is.

17:14.180 --> 17:15.640
A picture from back then.

17:15.640 --> 17:17.050
I still have it.

17:17.050 --> 17:19.200
Is Sanae telling the truth?

17:20.810 --> 17:23.220
That's the real Tokorozawa-sensei.

17:25.310 --> 17:26.460
He's not...

17:26.460 --> 17:27.540
very cool...

17:27.540 --> 17:30.150
He's totally different from Senpai's story.

17:30.150 --> 17:32.750
You think I'd start liking a guy like that?

17:34.170 --> 17:39.950
She starts rumors and tells fake stories because she wants to tease people, so you can't take her seriously.

17:39.950 --> 17:42.770
B-But... I still can't believe it.

17:42.770 --> 17:45.230
To think that Kise-senpai would lie like that.

17:45.230 --> 17:47.620
Well, she does crave attention, but...

17:47.620 --> 17:49.170
You're so cool, mister.

17:49.170 --> 17:49.960
That voice is...

17:51.340 --> 17:52.970
Me?

17:52.970 --> 17:56.350
You're just my type, mister.

17:56.350 --> 17:57.970
I'm just an old man.

17:58.310 --> 18:00.230
That's the good part.

18:00.230 --> 18:03.630
The unshaved mustache with gray hairs mixed in is dandy.

18:03.630 --> 18:05.200
You're too kind.

18:05.200 --> 18:07.490
Can you pay now?

18:07.490 --> 18:07.980
Yeah, you're right.

18:08.920 --> 18:10.340
I'm 100 yen short.

18:10.340 --> 18:11.650
What should I do?

18:11.650 --> 18:12.930
That's fine.

18:12.930 --> 18:13.760
Really?

18:13.760 --> 18:15.140
You're so awesome, mister!

18:15.140 --> 18:15.990
See?

18:16.410 --> 18:19.050
Swim team, 3rd year, Kise Sanae.

18:19.050 --> 18:21.440
She craves attention, likes to make up stories,

18:21.440 --> 18:24.440
and was actually more of a trouble maker than anyone else on the team.

18:28.910 --> 18:35.880
In the end, I don't know which parts of the story were true and which were false.

20:22.700 --> 20:25.910
Why don't we make a homepage for the Umisho swim team?!

20:26.910 --> 20:28.140
A homepage?

20:28.140 --> 20:29.340
Why?

20:29.340 --> 20:30.850
That's not needed for practice.

20:30.850 --> 20:32.790
That's not true!

20:33.560 --> 20:37.500
We can send our results from the prefectural tournament to all the world!

20:37.810 --> 20:39.550
All the world?

20:39.550 --> 20:41.790
No one will look at that homepage.

20:41.790 --> 20:43.400
It'll be troublesome to update it.

20:43.400 --> 20:45.900
You're all cold.

20:45.900 --> 20:47.260
I second that.

20:47.580 --> 20:48.820
Maaya-san!

20:48.820 --> 20:51.600
It's odd that we don't have a homepage.

20:52.010 --> 20:57.560
Put a bunch of pictures of Maaya on it, and then Maaya will go from being Maaya of Japan to Maaya of the world.

20:58.050 --> 20:59.610
So that's how it is in the end.

20:59.960 --> 21:01.720
Amuro seconds as well!

21:01.720 --> 21:03.110
Amuro of the world!

21:03.460 --> 21:06.170
There's definitely no reason to make something like that.

21:06.170 --> 21:07.640
There is!

21:07.640 --> 21:10.120
We can fund-raise with the homepage!

21:10.470 --> 21:14.330
If we do that, we can easily get back the budget they took from us!

21:15.790 --> 21:17.770
Then why don't you try making one?

21:17.770 --> 21:20.050
Since it's free to make a homepage, right?

21:20.050 --> 21:21.090
All right!

21:21.410 --> 21:25.020
I'll make a totally awesome homepage!

21:25.020 --> 21:27.740
Makio-chan sure likes to make up her mind suddenly.

21:36.530 --> 21:37.910
It's already done?

21:38.400 --> 21:40.070
I stayed up all night making it.

21:40.430 --> 21:42.030
Please take a look.

21:48.700 --> 21:50.260
You're good!

21:50.260 --> 21:51.700
I did it.

21:51.700 --> 21:56.180
Makio-chan, can you make something a little more normal?

21:56.920 --> 21:58.800
Which part of it should I fix?!

21:58.800 --> 21:59.880
Where?!

22:00.390 --> 22:02.960
Just think about it a little more.

22:03.250 --> 22:07.060
Instead of the internet, why don't you write it on paper?

22:07.060 --> 22:09.010
People can see it without a computer.

22:09.010 --> 22:11.930
That wouldn't make it a homepage.

22:14.720 --> 22:15.670
I see.

22:15.670 --> 22:17.440
The layout should be neat.

22:17.440 --> 22:20.440
Insteading of using the pictures as they are, I should process them.

22:20.440 --> 22:24.440
I see. Makio was lacking in that section.

22:24.440 --> 22:26.700
All right!

22:31.200 --> 22:33.200
I finished...

22:33.200 --> 22:35.700
Please take a look.

22:43.710 --> 22:44.930
It's pretty!

22:44.930 --> 22:47.140
Seriously! It's neat!

22:47.140 --> 22:48.290
The pictures are nice and elaborate.

22:48.290 --> 22:49.220
It looks good.

22:49.720 --> 22:52.150
I'll leave the site management to you.

22:52.150 --> 22:53.470
Yes!

22:54.220 --> 22:57.230
We're getting a lot of hits.

22:58.120 --> 23:01.240
It's because I posted on bunch of bulletin boards!

23:01.240 --> 23:02.990
Take a look at the member bios!

23:02.990 --> 23:05.610
I've mastered the skill of photo processing.

23:08.990 --> 23:11.560
Orizuka-senpai is so sexy!

23:11.560 --> 23:13.380
There's more.

23:15.600 --> 23:16.730
Is this Amuro?

23:16.730 --> 23:18.000
Awesome!

23:20.910 --> 23:22.000
This is...

23:22.560 --> 23:24.500
Aren't they processed nicely?

23:24.850 --> 23:29.800
I pasted the members' faces on pictures I found on the internet.

23:31.470 --> 23:33.760
That's Aikora!

23:36.520 --> 23:38.480
I also have the boy's as well.

23:40.690 --> 23:43.480
Kaname-chan, you look cool!

23:43.870 --> 23:46.300
Makio-chan, this is bad.

23:46.300 --> 23:47.750
Is it bad?

23:47.750 --> 23:49.530
Then how about these?

23:50.310 --> 23:53.220
Maybe we can go to cute route.

23:54.120 --> 23:56.750
We're not humans anymore!

23:56.750 --> 23:58.360
This one is better!

23:58.360 --> 23:59.600
No, it's not!

23:59.600 --> 24:01.370
Do you like it?

24:01.370 --> 24:03.290
No, like I said, Makio-chan...

24:03.550 --> 24:05.710
And take a look at this.

24:05.710 --> 24:08.440
This is my ideal figure!

24:12.260 --> 24:15.470
Like I said, this is bad!

24:17.010 --> 24:18.740
What's with this homepage?!

24:18.740 --> 24:20.160
This is the swim team's homepage!

24:20.160 --> 24:21.820
That's awesome!

24:22.400 --> 24:24.330
They saw it!

24:25.730 --> 24:27.450
Why are they laughing?

24:27.450 --> 24:29.780
Amuro will make one, too!

24:31.150 --> 24:34.830
With this, all of Umisho found out of our website,

24:34.830 --> 24:38.670
and the swim team's budget was cut even more.

24:45.910 --> 24:51.720
Um, next time on Umisho, it is the Ono Island festival.

24:52.670 --> 24:55.820
A trick to making your chest bigger?!

24:56.320 --> 24:59.470
Even if you say that, I don't know what to say....

25:00.520 --> 25:04.560
T-Then maybe a little bit...

25:05.460 --> 25:08.780
Next time on Kenkou Zenrakei Suieibu Umisho:

25:09.130 --> 25:10.290
"Nyuu Nyuu?"

25:10.710 --> 25:13.840
Um, can I stop now?
